    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“A snapshot of the organization's assets, liabilities and equity at a specific point in time.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/3>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Business Partner domain is defined as the concepts related to organizations conducting business with the organization. Includes concepts such as account, bill, interaction, problem, revenue & settlement and statistics.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/4>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“The business taxonomy categorizes and organizes data content that is to be used in the organization's Data Marketplace to enable a more intuitive user experience for browse & discovery.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/5>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“A report that shows the movement of cash into and out of the organization over a period of time.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/6>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“The process of managing the organization's cash flow to ensure liquidity and maximize returns.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/7>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“A report that shows the changes in the organization's equity over a period of time.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/8>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“An acronym for Controlled Unclassified Information is a category of federal ”unclassified information” the USG creates or processes, or that an entity creates or possesses for, or on behalf of, the US Government that requires safeguarding and dissemination protections. 1 the organization (the organization) CUI information examples include: Export Control, Systems Vulnerability, Technical Configurations, Controlled Technical Information”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/9>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“An abbreviation for Critical Infrastructure Information, this is data pertaining to U.S. critical infrastructure services provided by the organization.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/10>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Customer domain is defined by concepts relating to the individual or organization that has purchased products or services from the organization. Includes concepts such as billing, interactions, problems and statistics.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/11>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“A business approach that prioritizes customer needs and experiences in all aspects of operations. Includes the organization's Rewards”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/12>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Specific interactions a customer has the organization facing processes either digitally or external communications or internal interactions.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/13>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“An acronym for Earnings Before Interest, Taxes, Depreciation and Amortization, a measure of the organization's operating profitability.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/14>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“An abbreviation for Employee Information, this is records associated with employees (past or present) of the organization and is generally considered a subset or subcategory of PII. May also be called personnel information (PERS).”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/15>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Enterprise domain is defined as concepts related to the day-to-day business operations of the organization, including its people, finance, real estate, supply chain, information technology.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/16>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“This spoke manages the organization's financial planning, reporting and analysis.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/17>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Formal records that provide an overview of the organization's financial position and performance.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/18>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“A complete record of all financial transactions of the organization.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/19>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“A report that shows the organization's revenues, expenses and net income over a period of time.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/20>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“This spoke develops and implements strategies to promote the organization's products and services.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/21>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Indicates if the metric is reported internally within the organization, externally from the organization, or both.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/22>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“The processes and procedures of applying prices and discounts to the organization products & services.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/23>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Product domain is defined as concepts relating the physical items sold by the organization. Includes concepts such as offering, configuration, order, performance, usage, pricing and loyalty.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/24>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Information about which other the organization products or services a specific product can successfully interact with or be used alongside.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/25>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“The ability of the organization to generate profit.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/26>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Resource domain is defined as the concepts related to physical or logical items that support the services sold by the organization. Includes concepts such as capacity, configuration, order, performance, specification, test, topology and trouble.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/27>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“The rate at which the organization's revenue is increasing over time.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/28>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“The various sources from which the organization generates revenue.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/29>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Describes the traditional the organization derived sales groupings to which Marketplace content is related.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/30>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Service domain is defined as the concepts related to intangible offerings sold by the organization, such as wireless, home internet, the organization, FWA. Includes concepts such as configuration, order, performance, plan, usage and problems.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/31>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“Describes the traditional the organization business service areas to which Marketplace content is related.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261016T172335Z-review/32>
    a prov:Entity;
    rdfs:comment "“The management of the organization's financial resources, including cash, debt and equity.”"@en .
  
