  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261017T010309Z-review/1>
    rdfs:comment "“he integrated strategic capability, technical architecture, and operating model that systematically aggregates, governs, and transforms an organization's distributed data assets into contextualized intelligence and autonomous capabilities—driving operational automation, predictive decision-making, and proprietary product innovation at enterprise scale.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261017T010357Z-review/1>
    rdfs:comment "→ “Enterprise data & artificial intelligence” (old label kept as alternative)"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261017T014015Z-review/1>
    rdfs:comment "“The business taxonomy categorizes and organizes data content that is to be used in the organization's Data Marketplace to enable a more intuitive user experience for browse & discovery.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261017T014116Z-review/1>
    rdfs:comment "“The business taxonomy categorizes and organizes data content that is to be used in the organization's Data Marketplace to enable a more intuitive user experience for browsing and discovery.”"@en .
  
  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/20261017T014116Z-review/2>
    rdfs:comment "under “Partner role”; the taxonomy term is linked to it"@en .
  
